cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "T-Route Channel Geometry: Updating National Water Model RouteLink Channel Geometry with Machine-Learning Bankfull Estimates"
abstract: >-
  Python code that replaces the trapezoidal channel geometry in the National Water
  Model (NWM) RouteLink file with machine-learning predictions of bankfull width and
  depth from HydroGeom, for a user-selected channel shape, and recomputes the
  Muskingum routing parameters. The output is a RouteLink file that T-Route, the NWM
  routing model, can use directly.
